        <mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;b&gt;The Graph permissions belong to the app, not to people.&lt;/b&gt; The flow owner can be read-only in Entra; ER-02 and ER-03 call Graph through a connection that signs in as the platform app with its certificate." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF8DC;strokeColor=#D9B300;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontColor=#323130;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
